<title>PHILIPPINES: PLDT says 9-mth net at 4.653 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>PLDT says 9-mth net at 4.653 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>			  (in million pesos)</p>
<p>    Operating revenues	   21,135.5 vs 18,275.5</p>
<p>    Net income			4,670.2 vs 4,693.2</p>
<p>Note: Full name Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co. The 1995 net includes an unusual gain of 1.154 billion pesos.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8936</p>
</text>
